spec ww09-disjoint-nodes-lpg: 2 sessions, 20 permutations
# WW09 through the lpg API: two sessions, each incrementing only its own node twice.

starting permutation: s1w1 s1w2 s1c s2w1 s2w2 s2c
step s1w1: lpg: SetNodeProperty(a, v, v + 1)
